  "notes": "Cash basis; governmental funds only. Taxes lines kept as taxes (unlabeled): the Statement of Activities prints only 'Property and other taxes' 14,252,792 and the nonmajor combining schedule (p13) prints only total receipts per fund (Inheritance Tax 792,592, Visitor Promotion 291,550, 911 funds...), so no tax-type breakdown of the Taxes line. Local receipts classified charges for services (Statement of Activities charges for services 7,427,748 of 10,907,600) with review. Detail from the budget-and-actual schedules for every fund (General, Road and Bridge, COVID ARP, Detention, Capital Improvement, Nonmajor combined); the 35-fund nonmajor combining schedule (p13) prints only per-fund totals and is not recorded (budget schedule is more detailed). COVID ARP and Capital Improvement single receipt lines have no printed total. Nonmajor Public Health capital outlay actual blank (budget 100,000) omitted. Balance sheet from the governmental funds statement (equals the government-wide Statement of Net Position 14,079,008). Read pages 1-13 of 13"
